Package: writing-assistant
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, wl-clipboard, gnome-shell (>= 45)
Maintainer: Sajjad <sjadshakry87@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/sajjadele/writing_assistant
Description: System-wide English Writing & Expression Companion
 A hybrid desktop writing companion for Ubuntu / GNOME Wayland.
 Features an in-place Libadwaita HUD, Persian semantic anti-drift checkpoint,
 privacy-first local learning profile, and single-click text replacement.
